eator>Petrus Alfonsi</dc:creator><dc:date>13th century, first half</dc:date><dc:description>The present Codex contains the complete text of the Dialogus (ca. 1110–1120) of Petrus Alfonsi, a converted Jew from Huesca (since 1096 Kingdom of Aragon). The Dialogus is a polemic and apologetic work, introducing (for the time) innovative, in view of the author «rational» argumentation against Jewish religion and Islam. The work spread quickly and had significant influence on Christian polemics especially in the 13th and 14th century.</dc:description><dc:format>88 ff., 19 x 13 cm</dc:format><dc:identifier>doi:10.5076/e-codices-zbz-C0125</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/zbz/C0125</dc:identifier><dc:identifier>Zürich, Zentralbibliothek, Ms. C 125</dc:identifier><dc:publisher>e-codices - Virtual Manuscript Library of Switzerland</dc:publisher><dc:language>Latin</dc:language><dc:relation>Beschreibung von Carmen Cardelle de Hartmann, Darko Senekovic und Marlis Stähli, 2012.</dc:relation><dc:rights>e-codices / Zürich, Zentralbibliothek (cf. http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/about/terms)</dc:rights><dc:source rdf:resource="http://www.e-codices.unifr.ch/en/list/one/zbz/C0125"></dc:source><dc:title>Zürich, Zentralbibliothek, Ms. C 125 : Petrus Alfonsi, Dialogus</dc:title><dc:type>Manuscript</dc:type><dcterms:medium>Parchment</dcterms:medium><edm:europeanaProxy>false</edm:europeanaProxy><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_zbz_C0125"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/provider/9200211/en_list_one_zbz_C0125"/><edm:type>TEXT</edm:type></ore:Proxy><edm:EuropeanaAggregation rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/9200211/en_list_one_zbz_C0125"><edm:aggregatedCHO rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/9200211/en_list_one_zbz_C0125"/><edm:datasetName>9200211_Ag_EU_e-Codices</edm:datasetName><edm:country>Switzerland</edm:country><edm:preview rdf:resource="http: